flowchart LR
    Start[Receive request]
    subgraph Pipeline [Research pipeline]
        Intake[Prepare materials]
        subgraph Analysis [Evidence analysis]
            Extract[Extract facts]
            Review{Evidence sufficient?}
            Extract --> Review
        end
        Draft[Write report]
        Intake --> Extract
        Review -->|Yes| Draft
        Review -->|More evidence| Intake
    end
    Start --> Intake
    Draft --> Done([Publish])
